  "Your Spotify library and recent plays": "你的 Spotify 曲库和最近播放",
  "Your library shows what you keep and what Spotify ranks highest for you. Recent plays are your latest 50. A history ZIP can add years of listening later.": "曲库显示你收藏了什么，以及 Spotify 认为你最常听什么。最近播放是最新的 50 次。之后可以用历史 ZIP 补上多年的聆听。",
  "Spotify recent listening": "Spotify 最近聆听",
  "Your latest plays, up to 50. Spotify doesn't say how long you listened here. A history ZIP can add the older ones later.": "你最近的播放，最多 50 次。这里 Spotify 不提供聆听时长。之后可以用历史 ZIP 补上更早的播放。",
  "Your library with loves, ratings, play counts and when you last played each song. It doesn't list every play.": "你的曲库，包括喜爱、评分、播放次数和每首歌最后一次播放的时间。它不会列出每一次播放。",
  "ListenBrainz history": "ListenBrainz 历史",
  "Your saved listens. Some don't say how long you listened, so they count as plays without minutes.": "你保存的收听记录。有些没有聆听时长，所以只算播放次数、不计分钟。",
  "Spotify Extended Streaming History": "Spotify 完整播放历史",
  "Every play in this file, with how long you listened and how each song started and ended.": "这个文件里的每一次播放，包括你听了多久、每首歌怎么开始和结束。",
  "Spotify Account Data": "Spotify 账户数据",
  "Your plays from the past year, plus your library and playlists. For older plays and listening time, use Extended streaming history.": "过去一年的播放，加上你的曲库和歌单。想要更早的播放和聆听时长，请用完整播放历史（Extended streaming history）。",
  "Your library songs and YouTube Music plays, read in English or Chinese. Regular YouTube videos are left out. Google doesn't say how long you listened, and history you deleted or paused can't come back.": "你曲库里的歌和 YouTube Music 的播放，支持英文或中文导出。普通 YouTube 视频不计入。Google 不提供聆听时长，删除或暂停记录的历史也无法找回。",
  "{read} of {total} songs could be read; the service hides some. Only this playlist is added. It shows what you keep, not what you played, and it may not be one you made.": "读取到 {total} 首中的 {read} 首；平台隐藏了一部分。只会加入这个歌单。它显示的是你收藏了什么，而不是你听了什么，也不一定是你自己建的。",
  "{read} songs could be read; the service hides some. Only this playlist is added. It shows what you keep, not what you played, and it may not be one you made.": "读取到 {read} 首；平台隐藏了一部分。只会加入这个歌单。它显示的是你收藏了什么，而不是你听了什么，也不一定是你自己建的。",
  "Review your Spotify": "查看你的 Spotify",
  "Nothing is added until you import it.": "在你确认导入之前，不会加入任何内容。",
  "{songs} across {playlists}": "{playlists}共 {songs}",
  "{artists} and {tracks} from Spotify": "Spotify 统计的 {artists}和 {tracks}",
  "A very large library: Moondog read up to its limit and stopped there.": "曲库非常大：Moondog 读到上限就停下了。",
  "Your library isn't included: Reconnect Spotify to allow it.": "未包含你的曲库：重新连接 Spotify 以允许读取。",
  "{plays}, {first} to {last}": "{plays}，{first} 至 {last}",
  "No recent plays from Spotify right now.": "Spotify 现在没有最近播放。",
  "Add to my profile": "加入我的资料",
  "Read Spotify again": "重新读取 Spotify",
